{"nodes": [{"id": "recovered_request_3_to_original_works_1d_14d_connection_request_3_1d_14d_connection", "label": "Request 3 \u2014 is the 1D-14D transitional connection provable, and is it binary?", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "recovered/REQUEST-3-to-original-works-1D-14D-connection.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A different claim from Request 2's: the relation of the two axes themselves, so the earlier parallel-only verdict must not be cited as closing it."}, {"id": "recovered_request_3_to_original_works_1d_14d_connection_parallel_only_verdict", "label": "Request 2's verdict: parallel only", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/REQUEST-3-to-original-works-1D-14D-connection.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The seed laws do not bear on 14D and minimum-seed does not pair with the horizon; stating the distinction precisely is itself the result, and it guards the book against a seductive false bridge."}, {"id": "recovered_request_3_to_original_works_1d_14d_connection_binary_only_expressibility", "label": "Binary-only expressibility", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/REQUEST-3-to-original-works-1D-14D-connection.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A bit-reading keeps only each coordinate's extreme structure, which is exactly what survives a collapse, so a relation joining the two ends should be visible in the bit-reading and not at full resolution."}, {"id": "recovered_request_3_to_original_works_1d_14d_connection_origin_equals_horizon", "label": "origin = horizon (licensed form)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/REQUEST-3-to-original-works-1D-14D-connection.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "con